For 'enter', I want to prevent the lot from exceeding capacity, so I first stop if the current size equals capacity. Then I stop again if the requested spot is already occupied. Only then do I add that spot to the set. For 'exit', I remove the spot from the set only if it exists, so the operation does nothing if the parking spot was not taken. Once all events are handled, the occupied spots are sorted and returned as names.

