        return result

A record describes a car arriving or leaving the garage. Entering records the arrival time only if the car is not already parked; any second entry for the same car is ignored. Leaving for a car that is parked charges (exit time minus arrival time) times rate and removes the car; otherwise it is ignored. The output maps each car that left to its fee.

