The events can be of three kinds. "add", item, qty, price puts that many units of the item into the cart at the given price, overwriting whatever price was stored and adding to any existing quantity. "remove", item, qty takes that many units out, and if the quantity reaches zero or below the item is deleted from the cart; removing an item that is not present leaves the cart untouched. "clear" empties the cart entirely.

